to go that extra mile and tried to mimic  his watercolor vegeta manga i was very  pleased with how this one turned out and  compared to the original  and tackling this promo of goten and  trunks we have editor san in the style  of modern toriyama modern toriyama is a  tricky one to get right at least for me  and toriyama has a very particular way  of drawing characters those of you that  are unfamiliar with the kansan ban this  was a printed re-release of the original  dragon ball manga which featured new  toriyama artwork on their respective  covers which is exactly what editor-san  was going for with this one awesome work  just look at that comparison alright so  this brings us to the final image we  will be drawing this week and for that  we wanted to make it special the image  in question is this action shot of gohan  throwing his elbows towards the camera  and trev will be the artist drawing  and in the style of none other than the  iconic naotoshi shida naotoshi shida has  been an animator on dragon ball for  decades like many other prominent  animators like naoke tate masahiro  shimanuki and tarayoshi yamamuro  naotoshi shida cut his teeth with the  original series before becoming one of  the most highly regarded action  animators to have worked on dragon ball  ever he's responsible for some of the  most mind-bending scenes from battle of  gods the dragon ball super series and  indeed dragon ball super broly with his  signature style utilizing a ton of  extreme angles camera shakes strong  posing and of course sharp and detailed  shading work to help his images fly off  of the page once again the basic  structure for the most part with this 3d  bass structure was a great jumping off  point and gave trev the freedom to  immediately dive into the style of shita  without delay there's a sort of kinetic  intensity to his style and i genuinely  think trev absolutely nailed this one  all we have to do is apply mix's filter  to it one two three  wow that genuinely looks like something  straight from the anime or even dragon  ball super broly incredible work trev  and incredible work to everyone who  worked on these last two videos next  week professional animators that work  for toei will be joining us to help  bring these frames into the 2d world and  i hope you will join us for that very  special video if you don't want to miss  it be sure to like and subscribe but  until then i've been totally not mark  i'll see you all next weekend thank you  so much for watching  [Music]
 

